BT /F2 18.0 Tf 72.000 720.000 Td (Homography calibration chessboard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 687.600 Td (10 x 7 squares of 3.00 in \(9 x 6 inner corners\), with a 3 in white border: 36 x 27 in overall.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 671.760 Td (Set SQUARE_SIZE_INCHES = 3.0 in eocvsim/homography \(or the measured size, see step 6\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 655.920 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 640.080 Td (1. Print pages 2-19 at Actual size / 100% \(not Fit to page\). Both scale bars on every page) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 624.240 Td (   must measure exactly 6.00 in; if not, fix the printer scaling and reprint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 608.400 Td (2. Neighbouring tiles both print a 1/2 in band around their joint, marked by red ticks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 592.560 Td (   Trim each tile's margin anywhere between its ticks; aim for the middle tick, but the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 576.720 Td (   cut doesn't need to be accurate, only roughly straight.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 560.880 Td (3. Starting from A1, lay each trimmed edge over its neighbour's band. Slide it until the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 545.040 Td (   square edges run straight across the cut, then until both lines of every grey X do too.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 529.200 Td (   Tape it, check the X marks again, and glue. A window behind the sheets helps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 513.360 Td (4. Mount the whole board on foam board or a flat panel. It must be flat.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 497.520 Td (5. Measure several squares across joints and set SQUARE_SIZE_INCHES to the average.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 481.680 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 465.840 Td (Use: long side pointing away from the camera, near edge 3-6 in inside the camera's view,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.000 450.000 Td (with the whole white border visible.) Tj ET
